>    Here's a super-minimal example, based on debugging the objective
> function and/or options(error=recover)
>
> library(RTMB)
> p1 <- advector(5.0)
> p2 <- advector(0.5)
>
> try(pgamma(1, p1, p2))
> ## Error in pgamma(1, p1, p2) :
> ##  Non-numeric argument to mathematical function
>
