> ## [1] 0.0001721156
>
> dgamma(1, p1, p2)
> ## class='advector'
> ## [1] 0.0007897535
>
> So: pgamma() on plain R numeric values works, pgamma() on advectors
> fails, dgamma() on advectors works.
>
> Different sets of methods are defined for the two functions, but I'm not
> quite sure what to fix.
